  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Boil the kettle. Half-fill a large saucepan with boiling water, then add a generous pinch of salt.\n• Peel potato and cut into large chunks.\n• Cook potato in the boiling water, over high heat, until easily pierced with a fork, 12-15 minutes. Drain and return to the pan.\n• Add the milk and half the butter to potato and season with salt. Mash until smooth. Cover to keep warm. TIP: Save time and get more fibre by leaving the potato unpeeled.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-6715acf8ffa4e28ccb95b1dd-d993ddc8.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, finely chop brown onion.\n• Grate carrot.\n• Pick thyme leaves.\n• Drain and rinse lentils.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-6715acf8ffa4e28ccb95b1dd-c24d55f7.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Preheat the grill to high. In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over high heat.\n• Cook onion and carrot, stirring, until softened, 4-5 minutes.\n• Add thyme, tomato paste and half the garlic paste and cook until fragrant, 1 minute.\n• Add lentils, vegetable stock pot, the water and simmer, until thickened, 2-3 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-6715acf8ffa4e28ccb95b1dd-d8373a4b.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Transfer lentil filling to a baking dish. Top with potato topping, spreading it out evenly. Sprinkle over Parmesan cheese.\n• Grill until just golden, 8-10 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-6715acf8ffa4e28ccb95b1dd-3959fc40.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, trim green beans and baby broccoli.\n• Wipe out frying pan and return to medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil.\n• Cook green beans and baby broccoli, until tender, 4-5 minutes.\n• Add remaining garlic paste and cook, until fragrant, 1 minute. Season.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-6715acf8ffa4e28ccb95b1dd-b602e3de.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide the lentil shepherd's pie and garlic greens between plates. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-6715acf8ffa4e28ccb95b1dd-a75be974.jpeg"
    }
  ]
